# Stray Windows reserved-name artifact (a literal file named `nul`, created by a
# `> nul` redirect). Windows treats the name as the null device, so the Tailwind v4
# source scanner fatally errors trying to read it during globals.css processing.
# Ignoring it keeps the scanner (which respects .gitignore) from touching it.
/nul

